        "params": {
          "text": "### Share a style across tables\n\n**Table Style** holds a rule list and no data. Wire its **style** output into\nany number of **Show Table** cards' **style** input to give them one look from\none place. A Show Table's own rule box layers on top of an incoming style.\n",
          "width": 460,
          "height": 260
        },
        "code": null,
        "label": null
      }
